  "CAdam": { abstractEn: "CAdam proposes Context-Adaptive Moment Estimation for 3DGS densification in generative distillation, achieving 85-97% Gaussian reduction while preserving output quality through context-aware optimization.", abstractCn: "CAdam提出上下文自适应动量估计用于生成式蒸馏中的3DGS致密化，在保持输出质量的同时实现85-97%的高斯基元缩减。" },
