  "GEMM-GS": { abstractEn: "GEMM-compatible blending for Tensor Core utilization, 1.42x speedup [Abstract pending — contribution details to be added]", abstractCn: "GEMM-compatible blending 用于 Tensor Core utilization, 1.42x 加速。 [摘要待补充——贡献详情待添加]" },
  "HarmoGS": { abstractEn: "HarmoGS addresses in-the-wild 3DGS by proposing conflict-aware gradient harmonization. It combines semantic consistency-guided masking with dual-view gradient rotation into orthogonal configuration, plus conflict-aware densification and pruning to stabilize optimization under transient distractors and illumination inconsistencies.", abstractCn: "HarmoGS提出梯度冲突感知调和机制解决in-the-wild 3DGS问题。结合语义一致性引导掩码、双视图梯度正交旋转以及冲突感知密度控制，有效抑制瞬态干扰和光照不一致导致的重建伪影。" },
