  "Flow4DGS-SLAM": { abstractEn: "Optical flow-guided 4DGS for SLAM [Abstract pending — contribution details to be added]", abstractCn: "光流-guided 4DGS 用于 SLAM。 [摘要待补充——贡献详情待添加]" },
