  "FSGS": { abstractEn: "SRF geometric prior + 3DGS for few-shot view synthesis [Abstract pending — contribution details to be added]", abstractCn: "SRF geometric prior + 3DGS 用于 少样本 view synthesis。 [摘要待补充——贡献详情待添加]" },
