  "NIRRGB-GS": { abstractEn: "NIRRGB-GS proposes a multi-modal fusion 3DGS framework leveraging near-infrared imagery to assist low-light scene reconstruction and enhancement, bridging the modality gap between NIR structural information and RGB appearance details.", abstractCn: "NIRRGB-GS提出近红外辅助3DGS框架，融合NIR结构信息与RGB外观细节，实现暗光场景的高质量三维重建与增强。" },
