  "Underwater360": { abstractEn: "", abstractCn: "" },
  "3DEditSafe": { abstractEn: "3DEditSafe is the first safety-regularized 3D editing framework that constrains NSFW semantic propagation in text-driven 3DGS editing. It introduces a safety-aware regularization module that monitors and suppresses inappropriate content generation during the editing process. The approach ensures that user-specified edits remain within safe content boundaries while preserving editing quality and creative freedom.", abstractCn: "3DEditSafe是首个安全正则化3D编辑框架，约束文驱3DGS编辑中的不安全语义传播。它引入安全感知正则化模块，在编辑过程中监控并抑制不当内容生成。该方法确保用户指定的编辑保持在安全内容边界内，同时保留编辑质量和创作自由度。" },
  "4D-GSW": { abstractEn: "", abstractCn: "" },
  "BitC-3DGS": { abstractEn: "", abstractCn: "" },
  "GaussTrace": { abstractEn: "", abstractCn: "" },
  "GuardMarkGS": { abstractEn: "GuardMarkGS presents the first unified framework that combines watermark embedding and edit deterrence for 3DGS copyright protection. It trains an encoder-decoder network to embed imperceptible identity marks into Gaussian attributes and adds a deterrence module that degrades rendered quality upon unauthorized editing attempts. The dual mechanism provides both ownership verification and tamper resistance, addressing two critical gaps in prior 3D content protection schemes.", abstractCn: "GuardMarkGS提出了首个统一框架，将水印嵌入和编辑威慑相结合用于3DGS版权保护。它训练编码器-解码器网络将不可感知的身份标记嵌入高斯属性，并添加威慑模块在未经授权的编辑尝试时降低渲染质量。双重机制同时提供所有权验证和防篡改能力，弥补了先前3D内容保护方案的两个关键空白。" },
  "GaussianMarker": { abstractEn: "GaussianMarker embeds copyright watermarks into 3DGS with an uncertainty-aware mechanism that identifies and prioritizes Gaussians with high embedding capacity for mark insertion. It jointly optimizes a watermark encoder, scene reconstruction, and a robust decoder that resists common attacks including compression, cropping, and viewpoint perturbation. Experiments show high watermark extraction accuracy under various attacks while maintaining rendering quality comparable to unprotected scenes.", abstractCn: "GaussianMarker通过不确定性感知机制将版权水印嵌入3DGS，该机制识别并优先选择具有高嵌入容量的高斯进行标记插入。它联合优化水印编码器、场景重建和鲁棒解码器，抵抗包括压缩、裁剪和视点扰动在内的常见攻击。实验表明在各种攻击下具有高水印提取准确性，同时保持与未保护场景相当的渲染质量。" },
  "GeometryCloak": { abstractEn: "Geometric perturbation copyright watermark embedding into Gaussians preventing TGS-based 3D reconstruction [Abstract pending — contribution details to be added]", abstractCn: "几何扰动版权水印嵌入高斯防止基于TGS的3D重建。 [摘要待补充——贡献详情待添加]" },
  "GS-Hider": { abstractEn: "GS-Hider proposes a steganography framework that embeds hidden messages into the parameters of 3D Gaussian representations while preserving visual fidelity of the rendered scene. It allocates redundant capacity in Gaussian attributes (opacity, SH coefficients) for message encoding through a learnable embedding module trained jointly with scene reconstruction. The embedded information is visually lossless in rendered outputs and extractable without accessing the original training images.", abstractCn: "GS-Hider提出了一种隐写术框架，将隐藏信息嵌入3D高斯表示的参数中，同时保持渲染场景的视觉保真度。它通过可学习的嵌入模块分配高斯属性中的冗余容量进行信息编码，该模块与场景重建联合训练。嵌入的信息在渲染输出中视觉无损，并且无需访问原始训练图像即可提取。" },
